Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.38,0:03:04.00,TL,,0,0,380,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}You feel for Marta Kostyuk, who looked like she was going to win her first set of the week.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N科斯秋克险些拿到本周首盘
